     • Cursor / OpenCode / Hermes (no add CLI — paste config):
         /Users/runner/.local/bin/cua-driver mcp-config --client cursor     # JSON for ~/.cursor/mcp.json
         /Users/runner/.local/bin/cua-driver mcp-config --client opencode   # JSON for opencode.json
         /Users/runner/.local/bin/cua-driver mcp-config --client hermes     # YAML for ~/.hermes/config.yaml

     • ZCode (Z.ai — GUI app; paste in Settings → MCP Servers):
